# LAN Screen Share - AI Guidelines

- **Architecture**: This app uses WebRTC for peer-to-peer streaming and Socket.io via a custom Node.js server for signaling.
- **Rules**:
  - Always prefer explicit types in TypeScript.
  - No `any` types allowed.
  - Maintain the existing UI aesthetic (Tailwind CSS, Lenis, Lucide icons).
  - Do not route any streaming data through the internet or signaling server. P2P WebRTC only.
  - Self-signed SSL is mandatory for `getUserMedia` access on mobile.
